HOW TO USE THIS TEMPLATE
 1. Delete these notes (everything after the final closing brace) and save the file as MyGhazal26.json (next free number).
 2. Each couplet = one { ... } block with exactly TWO lines in each script.
 3. Put a comma after every couplet except the last. Keep the double quotes " " around every line.
 4. The first couplet is marked Matla automatically. Add  "maqta": true,  on the signature couplet.
 5. Optional: give your own title by adding after "poet":   "title": { "u": "...", "h": "...", "r": "..." },
 6. Only have Urdu for now? Leave out "h" and "r" — the page will show it in Urdu and say so politely.
